---
import StudioFrame from '../../components/StudioFrame.astro';
---

<StudioFrame title="会员管理" description="开通会籍及管理会员私密联络资料。" area="admin">
  <section class="studio-card admin-console" data-admin-members>
    <div class="admin-console-intro">
      <div>
        <span class="admin-section-label">会籍资料</span>
        <h2>开通一位会员的相册家谱</h2>
      </div>
      <p>一位会员对应一本私密相册家谱。电邮及手机号码为必填资料，仅用于学会会务联络，绝不出现在公开网站。</p>
    </div>
    <section class="admin-password-help" aria-labelledby="admin-password-help-title">
      <div><span class="admin-section-label">管理员密码</span><h3 id="admin-password-help-title">首次使用或忘记密码？</h3><p>点击后会把一封新的设置密码邮件寄到你的管理员电邮。请只使用最新一封邮件中的链接。</p></div>
      <button class="text-link" type="button" data-admin-password-reset>寄送设置密码邮件</button>
    </section>
    <section class="admin-panel admin-provision" aria-labelledby="admin-create-title">
      <h3 id="admin-create-title">新会员</h3>
      <p>系统会产生一次性的 8 位初始密码，且会同时含字母和数字；请用 WhatsApp 或纸本交给会员，不要以电邮发送密码。</p>
      <form class="studio-admin-form" data-admin-create-form>
      <div class="studio-fields">
        <label>会员号 <input name="memberId" placeholder="R1001" required /></label><label
          >会员姓名 <input name="displayName" required /></label
        ><label>联络电邮 <input name="contactEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label
          >手机号码 <input name="contactPhone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="例如：9272 8933" required /></label><label
          >开始日期 <input name="startsOn" type="date" required /></label
        ><label>结束日期 <input name="endsOn" type="date" required /></label>
      </div><button class="button" type="submit">开通会员与初始密码</button>
      </form>
    </section>
    <div class="admin-create-success" data-admin-create-success hidden role="status"><strong>会员已成功开通</strong><span data-admin-created-member></span> 已建立一份私密相册家谱；请在下方安全交付一次性密码。</div>
    <div class="studio-password-once" data-admin-password hidden>
      <strong>只显示一次</strong><p>
        <span data-admin-member-id></span> 的初始密码：<code data-admin-initial-password></code>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="admin-management-grid">
      <section class="admin-panel admin-reset-panel">
        <span class="admin-section-label">账户安全</span>
        <h3>重设会员初始密码</h3>
        <p>重设后，旧密码立即失效；新密码只会在这里显示一次。</p>
        <form class="studio-reset-form" data-admin-reset-form>
          <label>会员号 <input name="memberId" placeholder="R1001" required /></label><button
            class="text-link"
            type="submit">重设初始密码</button>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section class="admin-panel admin-credit-panel">
        <span class="admin-section-label">AI CREDITS / AI 额度</span>
        <h3>会费确认后发放额度</h3>
      <p>这里只记录额度，不连接收款，也不会启用 AI 供应商。以后可按会员号发放、补回或调整额度。</p>
      <form data-admin-credit-form>
        <div class="studio-fields">
          <label>会员号 <input name="memberId" placeholder="R1001" required /></label><label
            >额度 <input name="amount" type="number" min="1" step="1" required /></label
          ><label
            >记录类型 <select name="kind"
              ><option value="grant">发放</option><option value="purchase">购买</option><option value="refund"
                >补回</option
              ><option value="adjustment">调整</option></select
            ></label
          ><label>备注（可选）<input name="note" placeholder="例如：2026 年会员额度" /></label>
        </div>
        <button class="button" type="submit">记录额度</button>
      </form>
      </section>
    </div>
    <section class="admin-panel admin-pdf-setting" aria-labelledby="admin-pdf-setting-title">
      <span class="admin-section-label">MEMBER DOWNLOAD / 会员下载</span>
      <div class="admin-pdf-setting-row">
        <div><h3 id="admin-pdf-setting-title">允许会员下载 PDF</h3><p>关闭时，会员端不显示下载入口。开启时，只有有效会员可在自己的私密预览中使用「下载 PDF」；原始照片仍仅供管理员临时下载。</p></div>
        <label class="admin-switch"><input type="checkbox" data-admin-pdf-download-setting /><span aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>允许下载</strong></label>
      </div>
      <p class="admin-setting-status" data-admin-pdf-download-setting-status aria-live="polite">正在读取设置…</p>
    </section>
    <section class="admin-panel admin-export-panel" aria-labelledby="admin-export-title">
      <span class="admin-section-label">PRINT MATERIALS / 印书资料</span>
      <h3 id="admin-export-title">管理员临时下载照片原件</h3>
      <p>只在确定印书用途时生成 5 分钟有效的私有链接。每次生成都会记录管理员、会员号和用途。</p>
      <form class="studio-reset-form" data-admin-export-form>
        <label>会员号 <input name="memberId" placeholder="R1001" required /></label><label>用途 <input name="purpose" value="印制相册家谱" required /></label><button class="text-link" type="submit">生成临时下载链接</button>
      </form>
      <div class="admin-export-results" data-admin-export-results aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="admin-roster" aria-labelledby="admin-roster-title">
      <div class="admin-roster-heading">
        <div><span class="admin-section-label">私密名册</span><h3 id="admin-roster-title">现有会员</h3></div>
        <div class="admin-roster-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/admin/stories">公开故事审核 ↗</a><button class="text-link" type="button" data-admin-refresh>刷新名册</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-roster-filters" aria-label="筛选会员名册">
        <label>查找会员<input type="search" data-admin-search placeholder="会员号或姓名" /></label>
        <label>状态<select data-admin-status-filter><option value="all">全部状态</option><option value="active">有效</option><option value="suspended">暂停</option><option value="expired">届满</option></select></label>
        <label class="admin-expiring-filter"><input type="checkbox" data-admin-expiring /> 只看 30 日内到期</label>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-roster-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>会员</th><th>联络资料</th><th>会籍有效期</th><th>状态</th><th>管理</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody data-admin-member-list><tr><td colspan="5">正在读取会员资料…</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p class="studio-status" aria-live="polite" data-studio-status></p>
  </section>
</StudioFrame>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/admin-members';
</script>
